。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m027-0000","start":0,"end":5,"surface":"韋丞相玄成","kind":"person","person_id":"vna_am7_jn5_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m027-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"薛君","kind":"person","person_id":"ik4_61m_hqn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m027-0065","start":65,"end":68,"surface":"于丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"tks_56f_4ir","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m027-0093","start":93,"end":96,"surface":"孝元帝","kind":"person","person_id":"72m_dhb_tf7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m027-0177","start":177,"end":180,"surface":"韋丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"vna_am7_jn5_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m027-0186","start":186,"end":188,"surface":"匡衡","kind":"person","person_id":"484_day_gmv","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-096","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-096-zhang"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:p028","text":"丞相匡衡者，東海人也。好讀書，從博士受詩。家貧，衡傭作以給食飲。才下，數射策不中，至九，乃中丙科。其經以不中科故明習。補平原文學卒史。數年，郡不尊敬。御史徵之，以補百石屬薦為郎，而補博士，拜為太子少傅，而事孝元帝。孝元好詩，而遷為光祿勳，居殿中為師，授教左右，而縣官坐其旁聽，甚善之，日以尊貴。御史大夫鄭弘坐事免，而匡君為御史大夫。歲餘，韋丞相死，匡君代為丞相，封樂安侯。以十年之閒，不出長安城門而至丞相，豈非遇時而命也哉！","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m028-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"匡衡","kind":"person","person_id":"484_day_gmv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m028-0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"衡","kind":"person","person_id":"484_day_gmv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m028-0103","start":103,"end":106,"surface":"孝元帝","kind":"person","person_id":"72m_dhb_tf7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m028-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"孝元","kind":"person","person_id":"72m_dhb_tf7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m028-0151","start":151,"end":153,"surface":"鄭弘","kind":"person","person_id":"33z_av8_anq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m028-0158","start":158,"end":160,"surface":"匡君","kind":"person","person_id":"484_day_gmv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m028-0169","start":169,"end":172,"surface":"韋丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"vna_am7_jn5_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m028-0174","start":174,"end":176,"surface":"匡君","kind":"person","person_id":"484_day_gmv","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-096","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-096-zhang"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-040-jiachong-family","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-040","source_id":"s-jinshu-040-ws2606035-jiachong-family","source":{"title":"《晉書》卷四十賈充本傳及郭槐、韓謐、混、模、郭彰附傳","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=晉書/卷040&oldid=2606035","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=晉書/卷040&oldid=2606035","revision_id":2606035,"accessed_on":"2026-10-22","extent":"從賈充節題至楊駿節題前，完整30正文原段及原附傳標題；不含楊駿傳與卷末共評/贊，非全卷。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文公版；維基文庫數位文字保歸屬並依CC BY-SA4.0。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":null,"raw_file":"sources/witnesses/jin040-ws2606035.wikitext","raw_path":"sources/witnesses/jin040-ws2606035.wikitext","wikitext_sha256":"38ac429b64e7699696e334186968b077a2f66657c1ffcf597d58eca9d220f080","raw_file_sha256":"38ac429b64e7699696e334186968b077a2f66657c1ffcf597d58eca9d220f080","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"extraction_note":"僅去段首排版空白、顯示YL/無選項轉換包裹/單純wiki連結/粗體；保後/后、顗、南南等原字，不改字或添標點。"}}},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-096","source_id":"s-shiji-096-zhang","source":{"title":"史記／卷096","pr